<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Ridwan — Content & Outreach System</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=DM+Mono:wght@300;400;500&family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --black: #090909;
    --white: #ffffff;
    --gray: #222222;
    --gray-mid: #3a3a3a;
    --gray-light: #888;
    --blue: #007BFF;
    --blue-dim: #1a3a5c;
    --orange: #FF5722;
    --surface: #111111;
    --surface2: #181818;
    --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    background: var(--black);
    color: var(--white);
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  /* NAV */
  nav {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 16px 32px;
    background: rgba(9,9,9,0.92);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .nav-logo {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800; font-size: 18px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }
  .nav-logo span { color: var(--blue); }
  .nav-tabs { display: flex; gap: 4px; }
  .nav-tab {
    padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 6px; border: none;
    background: transparent; color: var(--gray-light);
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px;
    cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .nav-tab:hover { color: var(--white); background: var(--surface2); }
  .nav-tab.active { background: var(--blue); color: var(--white); }

  /* LAYOUT */
  .page { display: none; padding: 40px 32px; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .page.active { display: block; animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease; }
  @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }

  /* TYPOGRAPHY */
  .section-label {
    font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .page-title {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -1px; margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .page-sub {
    color: var(--gray-light); font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 40px;
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  /* CARDS */
  .card {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;
  }
  .card-title {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  .grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  .col-span-2 { grid-column: span 2; }

  /* PILLARS */
  .pillar {
    border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .pillar::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px;
  }
  .pillar.blue::before { background: var(--blue); }
  .pillar.orange::before { background: var(--orange); }
  .pillar.white::before { background: var(--white); }
  .pillar-num {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif; font-style: italic;
    font-size: 48px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: -8px;
  }
  .pillar-name {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .pillar-desc { color: var(--gray-light); font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .tag-list { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
  .tag {
    font-size: 10px; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  /* WEEKLY CALENDAR */
  .week-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr);
    gap: 8px; margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .day-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
  .day-header {
    font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: var(--gray-light); text-align: center; padding: 6px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .post-block {
    border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px;
    font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.4; cursor: default;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }
  .post-block.linkedin { background: rgba(0,123,255,0.12); border-color: rgba(0,123,255,0.25); }
  .post-block.instagram { background: rgba(255,87,34,0.1); border-color: rgba(255,87,34,0.2); }
  .post-block.twitter { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
  .post-block.rest { background: transparent; color: var(--gray-light); text-align: center; padding: 12px 6px; font-size: 10px; }
  .post-platform { font-size: 9px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; opacity: 0.7; margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .post-type { font-weight: 500; color: var(--white); }

  /* POST FORMATS */
  .format-row {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr 80px 100px;
    align-items: start; gap: 16px; padding: 14px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .format-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .format-platform {
    font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .format-platform.li { color: var(--blue); }
  .format-platform.ig { color: var(--orange); }
  .format-platform.tw { color: #9CA3AF; }
  .format-name { font-weight: 500; color: var(--white); font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .format-desc { color: var(--gray-light); font-size: 11px; }
  .format-freq {
    font-size: 11px; color: var(--gray-light); text-align: right;
  }
  .format-goal {
    font-size: 10px; color: var(--blue); text-align: right;
  }

  /* OUTREACH PIPELINE */
  .pipeline { display: flex; gap: 12px; overflow-x: auto; padding-bottom: 8px; }
  .pipe-col { min-width: 180px; }
  .pipe-header {
    font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: var(--gray-light); margin-bottom: 10px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  }
  .pipe-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; }
  .pipe-card {
    background: var(--surface2); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 11px;
  }
  .pipe-card-title { font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .pipe-card-sub { color: var(--gray-light); font-size: 10px; }

  /* CAPTION BUILDER */
  .caption-section { margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .caption-label {
    font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: var(--gray-light); margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .caption-block {
    background: var(--surface2); border-left: 2px solid var(--blue);
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; padding: 14px 16px;
    font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
  }
  .caption-block em { color: var(--blue); font-style: normal; }

  /* BRAND VOICE */
  .voice-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; }
  .voice-card {
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .voice-card.do { border-color: rgba(0,123,255,0.3); background: rgba(0,123,255,0.05); }
  .voice-card.dont { border-color: rgba(255,87,34,0.25); background: rgba(255,87,34,0.04); }
  .voice-heading {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .voice-heading.do { color: var(--blue); }
  .voice-heading.dont { color: var(--orange); }
  .voice-item { font-size: 11px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 12px; position: relative; }
  .voice-item::before { content: '—'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--gray-light); }

  /* AUTOMATION FLOW */
  .flow { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .flow-step {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;
    min-width: 140px; flex: 1;
  }
  .flow-box {
    width: 100%; background: var(--surface2); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px; text-align: center; position: relative;
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .flow-icon { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .flow-name { font-weight: 500; font-size: 12px; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .flow-tool { color: var(--blue); font-size: 10px; }
  .flow-arrow {
    display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 4px; padding-top: 28px;
    color: var(--gray-mid); font-size: 18px;
  }

  /* IDEA BANK */
  .idea-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .idea-item {
    display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px;
    padding: 14px; border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--surface2); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    cursor: pointer; transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .idea-item:hover { border-color: rgba(0,123,255,0.4); }
  .idea-badge {
    font-size: 9px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;
    padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; white-space: nowrap; margin-top: 1px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .idea-badge.cro { background: rgba(0,123,255,0.15); color: var(--blue); }
  .idea-badge.design { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); }
  .idea-badge.personal { background: rgba(255,87,34,0.1); color: var(--orange); }
  .idea-badge.freelance { background: rgba(100,200,100,0.1); color: #6bcb6b; }
  .idea-text { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); line-height: 1.5; }
  .idea-hook { font-weight: 500; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .idea-desc { font-size: 11px; color: var(--gray-light); }

  /* SEPARATOR */
  .sep { height: 1px; background: var(--border); margin: 32px 0; }

  /* METRICS */
  .metric-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 12px; }
  .metric-box {
    background: var(--surface2); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; text-align: center;
  }
  .metric-val {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 28px;
    color: var(--blue); line-height: 1;
  }
  .metric-label { font-size: 10px; color: var(--gray-light); margin-top: 6px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; }

  /* SCROLLBAR */
  ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 4px; height: 4px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--gray-mid); border-radius: 4px; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    nav { padding: 12px 16px; }
    .page { padding: 24px 16px; }
    .grid-2, .grid-3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .col-span-2 { grid-column: span 1; }
    .week-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
    .format-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .metric-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .voice-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .nav-tabs { gap: 2px; }
    .nav-tab { padding: 5px 8px; font-size: 11px; }
  }

  /* ── IDEA GENERATOR ADDITIONS ── */
  .new-idea { border-color: rgba(255,149,0,0.4) !important; background: rgba(255,149,0,0.04) !important; }
  .idea-badges { display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
  .new-badge {
    background: rgba(255,149,0,0.15); color: #FF9500;
    font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,149,0,0.3);
  }
  .idea-format {
    font-size: 10px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.28);
    letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 5px; display: block;
  }
  .idea-bank-summary {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .idea-sum-card {
    background: #111; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px;
  }
  .idea-sum-label {
    font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.28); margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .idea-sum-value {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 28px; line-height: 1;
  }
  .idea-month-block {
    background: #111; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px;
  }
  .idea-month-head {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px;
    align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .idea-month-title {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.05;
  }
  .idea-month-sub {
    font-size: 11px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    margin-top: 6px; max-width: 520px;
  }
  .idea-month-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .idea-month-link {
    padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.82);
    font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .idea-month-link:hover { background: #111; border-color: #007BFF; color: #fff; }
  .idea-month-grid { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .idea-controls-wrap {
    margin-top: 32px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;
  }
  .idea-ctrl-card {
    background: #111; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px;
  }
  .idea-ctrl-label {
    font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .idea-ctrl-desc {
    font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .idea-ctrl-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  .idea-ctrl-note {
    font-size: 10px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.18); margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .notion-btn {
    padding: 10px 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg,#FF9500,#7B2FBE);
    border: none; border-radius: 8px; color: #fff;
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .gen-btn {
    padding: 10px 20px; background: #111;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); border-radius: 8px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .ctrl-status {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
  }
  .gen-textarea {
    width: 100%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 12px; font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px; color: #fff; outline: none; resize: none;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .idea-bank-summary { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="nav-logo">koolest<span>pro</span></div>
  <div class="nav-tabs">
    <button class="nav-tab active" onclick="showPage('overview', this)">System</button>
    <button class="nav-tab" onclick="showPage('content', this)">Content</button>
    <button class="nav-tab" onclick="showPage('captions', this)">Captions</button>
    <button class="nav-tab" onclick="showPage('outreach', this)">Outreach</button>
    <button class="nav-tab" onclick="showPage('ideas', this)">Idea Bank</button>
    <a class="nav-tab" href="content_pipeline.html" style="text-decoration:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;background:rgba(255,149,0,0.12);color:#FF9500;border:1px solid rgba(255,149,0,0.25);">⚡ Pipeline</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- PAGE: SYSTEM OVERVIEW -->
<div class="page active" id="page-overview">
  <div class="section-label">Content & Growth System</div>
  <h1 class="page-title">Your Full Brand Engine</h1>
  <p class="page-sub">3 content pillars. 3 platforms. 1 outreach machine. Built around your brand — design-first, conversion-focused, no fluff.</p>

  <div class="metric-row" style="margin-bottom:32px;">
    <div class="metric-box">
      <div class="metric-val">3–4</div>
      <div class="metric-label">Posts / week</div>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-box">
      <div class="metric-val">3</div>
      <div class="metric-label">Platforms</div>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-box">
      <div class="metric-val">3</div>
      <div class="metric-label">Content Pillars</div>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-box">
      <div class="metric-val">∞</div>
      <div class="metric-label">Repurpose Loops</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-label">Content Pillars</div>
  <div class="grid-3" style="margin-bottom:32px;">
    <div class="pillar blue">
      <div class="pillar-num">01</div>
      <div class="pillar-name">Digital Craftsmanship</div>
      <div class="pillar-desc">Design + Development education. Your core expertise made accessible.</div>
      <div class="tag-list">
        <span class="tag">Web design</span>
        <span class="tag">Shopify</span>
        <span class="tag">PageFly</span>
        <span class="tag">Figma</span>
        <span class="tag">GSAP</span>
        <span class="tag">Typography</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar orange">
      <div class="pillar-num">02</div>
      <div class="pillar-name">Conversion Strategy</div>
      <div class="pillar-desc">CRO-driven thinking. Attract store owners who care about results, not looks.</div>
      <div class="tag-list">
        <span class="tag">CRO</span>
        <span class="tag">Landing pages</span>
        <span class="tag">Above the fold</span>
        <span class="tag">A/B testing</span>
        <span class="tag">Trust signals</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar white">
      <div class="pillar-num">03</div>
      <div class="pillar-name">Builder's Journey</div>
      <div class="pillar-desc">Your story. Freelancing, growth, systems. Builds trust and human connection.</div>
      <div class="tag-list">
        <span class="tag">Freelancing</span>
        <span class="tag">Personal brand</span>
        <span class="tag">Productivity</span>
        <span class="tag">Building in public</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-label">Automation Flow</div>
  <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:32px;">
    <div class="card-title">How one idea becomes 9 pieces of content</div>
    <div class="flow" style="margin-top:16px;">
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-box">
          <div class="flow-icon">💡</div>
          <div class="flow-name">Idea</div>
          <div class="flow-tool">Claude / Kortex</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-arrow">→</div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-box">
          <div class="flow-icon">✍️</div>
          <div class="flow-name">Long-form Draft</div>
          <div class="flow-tool">Claude AI</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-arrow">→</div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-box">
          <div class="flow-icon">🎨</div>
          <div class="flow-name">Graphic</div>
          <div class="flow-tool">Figma template</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-arrow">→</div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-box">
          <div class="flow-icon">✂️</div>
          <div class="flow-name">Repurpose</div>
          <div class="flow-tool">3 platforms</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-arrow">→</div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-box">
          <div class="flow-icon">🚀</div>
          <div class="flow-name">Schedule</div>
          <div class="flow-tool">Publer / Buffer</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-arrow">→</div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-box">
          <div class="flow-icon">🎯</div>
          <div class="flow-name">Outreach</div>
          <div class="flow-tool">Cold DM / email</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p style="color:var(--gray-light); font-size:11px; margin-top:16px;">One core idea → LinkedIn article + carousel + Twitter thread + Instagram carousel + 3 short tweets + 2 reels scripts + outreach hook. That's 9 pieces from 1 idea.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-label">Brand Voice</div>
  <div class="voice-grid">
    <div class="voice-card do">
      <div class="voice-heading do">Write like this ✓</div>
      <div class="voice-item">Direct, confident, no filler words</div>
      <div class="voice-item">Lead with the problem, end with the fix</div>
      <div class="voice-item">Use your own frameworks (Design First, 3C, USER)</div>
      <div class="voice-item">Call out bad practices by name</div>
      <div class="voice-item">Short sentences. One idea per line on Twitter.</div>
      <div class="voice-item">Use numbers and specifics ("3 things", "2x clicks")</div>
      <div class="voice-item">Reference client results and real work</div>
    </div>
    <div class="voice-card dont">
      <div class="voice-heading dont">Never write like this ✗</div>
      <div class="voice-item">"In today's fast-paced digital world..."</div>
      <div class="voice-item">Vague tips without proof or context</div>
      <div class="voice-item">Posting just to post (no angle, no point)</div>
      <div class="voice-item">Over-explaining what you do instead of showing it</div>
      <div class="voice-item">Begging for engagement ("Like if you agree")</div>
      <div class="voice-item">Fluffy motivational quotes with no substance</div>
      <div class="voice-item">Corporate tone or overly formal language</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- PAGE: CONTENT CALENDAR -->
<div class="page" id="page-content">
  <div class="section-label">Weekly Rhythm</div>
  <h1 class="page-title">Content Calendar</h1>
  <p class="page-sub">A repeatable weekly structure. Same slots, rotating topics across your 3 pillars.</p>

  <div class="week-grid">
    <div class="day-col">
      <div class="day-header">Mon</div>
      <div class="post-block linkedin">
        <div class="post-platform">LinkedIn</div>
        <div class="post-type">CRO tip or design breakdown</div>
      </div>
      <div class="post-block twitter">
        <div class="post-platform">Twitter/X</div>
        <div class="post-type">Thread teaser or quote from the LI post</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="day-col">
      <div class="day-header">Tue</div>
      <div class="post-block instagram">
        <div class="post-platform">Instagram</div>
        <div class="post-type">Carousel: "Before / After" or design tip</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="day-col">
      <div class="day-header">Wed</div>
      <div class="post-block twitter">
        <div class="post-platform">Twitter/X</div>
        <div class="post-type">Hot take or unpopular opinion</div>
      </div>
      <div class="post-block linkedin">
        <div class="post-platform">LinkedIn</div>
        <div class="post-type">Personal story / builder journey post</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="day-col">
      <div class="day-header">Thu</div>
      <div class="post-block instagram">
        <div class="post-platform">Instagram</div>
        <div class="post-type">Case study reel or project showcase</div>
      </div>
      <div class="post-block twitter">
        <div class="post-platform">Twitter/X</div>
        <div class="post-type">Quick tip: 1 thing, 1 fix, 1 result</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="day-col">
      <div class="day-header">Fri</div>
      <div class="post-block linkedin">
        <div class="post-platform">LinkedIn</div>
        <div class="post-type">Full thread / carousel: Shopify framework</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="day-col">
      <div class="day-header">Sat</div>
      <div class="post-block instagram">
        <div class="post-platform">Instagram</div>
        <div class="post-type">Behind the scenes / WIP</div>
      </div>
      <div class="post-block twitter">
        <div class="post-platform">Twitter/X</div>
        <div class="post-type">Reflection or week's lesson learned</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="day-col">
      <div class="day-header">Sun</div>
      <div class="post-block rest">Rest or batch next week's content</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sep"></div>

  <div class="section-label">Post Formats by Platform</div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="format-row">
      <div><div class="format-platform li">LinkedIn</div></div>
      <div><div class="format-name">Text post with hook</div><div class="format-desc">Short punchy opening line → 3–5 bullet tips → CTA. Best for reach.</div></div>
      <div class="format-freq">3x / week</div>
      <div class="format-goal">Authority + leads</div>
    </div>
    <div class="format-row">
      <div><div class="format-platform li">LinkedIn</div></div>
      <div><div class="format-name">Document carousel</div><div class="format-desc">10-slide PDF. Deep breakdown of one topic (e.g. "PageFly Homepage Formula"). High saves.</div></div>
      <div class="format-freq">1x / week</div>
      <div class="format-goal">Saves + shares</div>
    </div>
    <div class="format-row">
      <div><div class="format-platform ig">Instagram</div></div>
      <div><div class="format-name">Carousel post</div><div class="format-desc">Design-led slides. Bold cover, value inside, CTA slide last. Repurposed from LI doc.</div></div>
      <div class="format-freq">2x / week</div>
      <div class="format-goal">Followers + DMs</div>
    </div>
    <div class="format-row">
      <div><div class="format-platform ig">Instagram</div></div>
      <div><div class="format-name">Reel (15–30s)</div><div class="format-desc">Before/after screen recording. Project breakdown. Fast, punchy edit. B-roll of Figma or Shopify.</div></div>
      <div class="format-freq">1x / week</div>
      <div class="format-goal">Reach + discovery</div>
    </div>
    <div class="format-row">
      <div><div class="format-platform tw">Twitter/X</div></div>
      <div><div class="format-name">Thread</div><div class="format-desc">1 framework or system. Hook tweet + 7–10 numbered tweets + summary. Full value, no paywall.</div></div>
      <div class="format-freq">1x / week</div>
      <div class="format-goal">Followers + RT</div>
    </div>
    <div class="format-row">
      <div><div class="format-platform tw">Twitter/X</div></div>
      <div><div class="format-name">Single tweet</div><div class="format-desc">1 punchy insight, hot take, or quote from your Big Ideas list. 240 chars max.</div></div>
      <div class="format-freq">3–4x / week</div>
      <div class="format-goal">Engagement + follows</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- PAGE: CAPTIONS -->
<div class="page" id="page-captions">
  <div class="section-label">Caption Templates</div>
  <h1 class="page-title">Post Structures</h1>
  <p class="page-sub">Repeatable caption formulas in your voice. Fill in the blanks, ship it.</p>

  <div class="caption-section">
    <div class="caption-label">Formula 1 — The Problem/Fix (LinkedIn & Twitter)</div>
    <div class="caption-block">
      <em>Most [target] do [common mistake].</em><br>
      And it's costing them [specific consequence].<br><br>
      Here's what they should do instead:<br><br>
      → [Fix #1]<br>
      → [Fix #2]<br>
      → [Fix #3]<br><br>
      [1 sentence on why this works].<br><br>
      Save this before your next [relevant action].
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="caption-section">
    <div class="caption-label">Formula 2 — The Hook + List (LinkedIn)</div>
    <div class="caption-block">
      <em>[Bold, specific claim that challenges a belief].</em><br><br>
      I've [built/audited/redesigned] [number] Shopify stores.<br>
      Here's what actually moves the needle:<br><br>
      1. [Point 1]<br>
      2. [Point 2]<br>
      3. [Point 3]<br><br>
      [Result or consequence if ignored].<br><br>
      Which one are you missing? Drop it below.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="caption-section">
    <div class="caption-label">Formula 3 — The Story (LinkedIn & Instagram)</div>
    <div class="caption-block">
      <em>[Open with a moment — not a statement. Put the reader in the scene.]</em><br><br>
      [2–3 sentences of context. What was the problem or situation?]<br><br>
      [What did you do? What decision was made?]<br><br>
      Result: [Specific, tangible outcome].<br><br>
      The lesson: [One clear takeaway].<br><br>
      [Question to the reader to spark comments.]
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="caption-section">
    <div class="caption-label">Formula 4 — Twitter Thread Opener</div>
    <div class="caption-block">
      <em>[1 sentence. No warm-up. Start with the most interesting thing.]</em><br><br>
      Here's the full breakdown (thread 🧵):
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="caption-section">
    <div class="caption-label">Formula 5 — Instagram Carousel Caption</div>
    <div class="caption-block">
      <em>[First line = the hook. Must stop the scroll.]</em><br><br>
      Swipe to see [what they'll get].<br><br>
      [2–3 lines of value or context].<br><br>
      Save this for later. Follow @koolestpro for more Shopify design tips.<br><br>
      #ShopifyDesign #eCommerce #WebDesign #CRO #PageFly #ShopifyDeveloper
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="caption-section">
    <div class="caption-label">Formula 6 — Before/After Post</div>
    <div class="caption-block">
      <em>This store was losing sales. Not because the product was bad —</em><br>
      <em>because the page was working against it.</em><br><br>
      Before: [Problem 1], [Problem 2], [Problem 3].<br><br>
      After: [Fix 1], [Fix 2], [Fix 3].<br><br>
      Result: [Metric or qualitative win].<br><br>
      Design isn't decoration. It's direction.<br><br>
      DM me "AUDIT" if you want me to look at your store.
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- PAGE: OUTREACH -->
<div class="page" id="page-outreach">
  <div class="section-label">Inbound + Outbound Machine</div>
  <h1 class="page-title">Client Acquisition System</h1>
  <p class="page-sub">Your content builds authority. Your outreach converts it. Here's how both work together.</p>

  <div class="grid-2" style="margin-bottom:32px;">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="color:var(--blue);">Inbound (Content → DMs)</div>
      <p style="color:var(--gray-light); font-size:12px; margin-bottom:16px;">Your posts do the selling. By the time someone DMs you, they already trust you.</p>
      <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px;">
        <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start;">
          <div style="min-width:20px; height:20px; background:var(--blue); border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:10px; font-weight:700; margin-top:1px;">1</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;">Post valuable content 3–4x/week (pillar topics)</div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start;">
          <div style="min-width:20px; height:20px; background:var(--blue); border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:10px; font-weight:700; margin-top:1px;">2</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;">End every post with a soft or hard CTA ("DM me AUDIT" / "Link in bio")</div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start;">
          <div style="min-width:20px; height:20px; background:var(--blue); border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:10px; font-weight:700; margin-top:1px;">3</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;">Engage in comments — especially on posts from store owners</div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start;">
          <div style="min-width:20px; height:20px; background:var(--blue); border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:10px; font-weight:700; margin-top:1px;">4</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;">When someone engages on a CRO or store post → follow up with a DM</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="color:var(--orange);">Outbound (Proactive Cold Outreach)</div>
      <p style="color:var(--gray-light); font-size:12px; margin-bottom:16px;">Find stores with design problems. Lead with value, not a pitch.</p>
      <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px;">
        <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start;">
          <div style="min-width:20px; height:20px; background:var(--orange); border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:10px; font-weight:700; margin-top:1px;">1</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;">Find prospect (Shopify store, IG/LinkedIn, ads running = budget)</div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start;">
          <div style="min-width:20px; height:20px; background:var(--orange); border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:10px; font-weight:700; margin-top:1px;">2</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;">Do a 2-minute audit: find 2–3 specific problems on their store</div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start;">
          <div style="min-width:20px; height:20px; background:var(--orange); border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:10px; font-weight:700; margin-top:1px;">3</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;">Send a personalized DM with 1 specific observation (not a pitch)</div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start;">
          <div style="min-width:20px; height:20px; background:var(--orange); border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:10px; font-weight:700; margin-top:1px;">4</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;">If no reply in 48h → 1 follow up. Then move on.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-label">Cold DM Templates</div>
  <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:16px; margin-bottom:32px;">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">Template A — The Observation DM (LinkedIn / Instagram)</div>
      <div class="caption-block" style="margin-top:12px;">
        Hey [Name], I was browsing Shopify stores in [niche] and came across yours.<br><br>
        Noticed your product page doesn't show trust signals above the fold — no reviews, no guarantee badge visible before the scroll.<br><br>
        That's usually the #1 reason good products don't convert.<br><br>
        Not a pitch — just thought it was worth mentioning. Happy to share a quick fix if helpful.
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">Template B — The Audit Offer DM</div>
      <div class="caption-block" style="margin-top:12px;">
        Hey [Name], quick one —<br><br>
        I do free 5-minute video audits for Shopify stores. I look at your homepage, product page, and checkout flow, then record a short Loom with what I'd fix first.<br><br>
        No strings. I just enjoy spotting the stuff most people miss.<br><br>
        Want me to take a look at [store name]?
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">Template C — The Content-to-DM (use after they engage with your post)</div>
      <div class="caption-block" style="margin-top:12px;">
        Glad the post resonated — that one comes up a lot when I audit stores.<br><br>
        Do you have a Shopify store? I'd be curious what your [product page / homepage] looks like. I audit them for free when I have the bandwidth.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-label">Pipeline Stages</div>
  <div class="pipeline">
    <div class="pipe-col">
      <div class="pipe-header"><div class="pipe-dot" style="background:#888;"></div> Prospecting</div>
      <div class="pipe-card">
        <div class="pipe-card-title">Find stores</div>
        <div class="pipe-card-sub">IG ads, Shopify .myshopify.com domains, LinkedIn store owners</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pipe-card">
        <div class="pipe-card-title">Quick audit</div>
        <div class="pipe-card-sub">2 min review — note 2–3 real problems</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pipe-col">
      <div class="pipe-header"><div class="pipe-dot" style="background:var(--blue);"></div> Outreach</div>
      <div class="pipe-card">
        <div class="pipe-card-title">Send DM</div>
        <div class="pipe-card-sub">Template A or B, fully personalized</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pipe-card">
        <div class="pipe-card-title">Follow up</div>
        <div class="pipe-card-sub">Once, after 48h, different angle</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pipe-col">
      <div class="pipe-header"><div class="pipe-dot" style="background:var(--orange);"></div> Nurture</div>
      <div class="pipe-card">
        <div class="pipe-card-title">Loom audit</div>
        <div class="pipe-card-sub">Free 5-min video = massive trust builder</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pipe-card">
        <div class="pipe-card-title">Discovery call</div>
        <div class="pipe-card-sub">Understand budget, scope, timeline</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pipe-col">
      <div class="pipe-header"><div class="pipe-dot" style="background:#6bcb6b;"></div> Close</div>
      <div class="pipe-card">
        <div class="pipe-card-title">Send proposal</div>
        <div class="pipe-card-sub">Scope + price + timeline. Simple doc.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pipe-card">
        <div class="pipe-card-title">Onboard</div>
        <div class="pipe-card-sub">Brief form, contract, first payment</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pipe-col">
      <div class="pipe-header"><div class="pipe-dot" style="background:#c084fc;"></div> Retain</div>
      <div class="pipe-card">
        <div class="pipe-card-title">Deliver + delight</div>
        <div class="pipe-card-sub">Over-communicate, show progress early</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pipe-card">
        <div class="pipe-card-title">Referral ask</div>
        <div class="pipe-card-sub">Ask after first result. Most say yes.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- PAGE: IDEA BANK -->
<div class="page" id="page-ideas">
  <div class="section-label">Content Ideas</div>
  <h1 class="page-title">Idea Bank</h1>
  <p class="page-sub">Monthly idea sets generated through your skill stack. Each month stays linked to the pipeline and its dedicated idea review interface.</p>

  <div class="idea-bank-summary" id="idea-bank-summary"></div>
  <div class="idea-list" id="idea-bank-months"></div>

  <!-- ── IDEA GENERATOR CONTROLS ── -->
  <div class="idea-controls-wrap">

    <div class="idea-ctrl-card">
      <div class="idea-ctrl-label" style="color:#FF9500;">Open Pipeline</div>
      <div class="idea-ctrl-desc">Jump into the content pipeline to manage posts, track status, and import JSON exported from any generated post. Use the <strong style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);">⬆ Import Post JSON</strong> button in the pipeline footer to merge new posts by ID.</div>
      <div class="idea-ctrl-row">
        <a class="notion-btn" href="content_pipeline.html" style="text-decoration:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;">Open Pipeline →</a>
        <span class="ctrl-status" id="pipeline-sync-status">Synced · <span id="current-month-count">—</span> ideas this month</span>
      </div>
      <div class="idea-ctrl-note">Posts with a generated file show an <strong style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);">⌁ Open file →</strong> link that opens the HTML directly in your browser.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="idea-ctrl-card">
      <div class="idea-ctrl-label" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);">Generate More Ideas</div>
      <div class="idea-ctrl-desc">Give a starting point and the Idea Generator skill will research, generate, and update the synced monthly idea bank for the current month.</div>
      <textarea class="gen-textarea" id="new-idea-prompt" rows="2"
        placeholder="e.g. 'Instagram DM store owners' or 'Shopify checkout fixes' or just 'more CRO ideas'"></textarea>
      <button class="gen-btn" onclick="triggerIdeaGen()">Research + Generate →</button>
      <div class="idea-ctrl-note">Copies a ready-to-paste prompt for the Idea Generator skill in Cowork.</div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

