f 6 structural components: hook, problem agitation, story, proof, product reveal, CTA.", "angle": "Design First, Develop Fast — build the belief layer before building the buy button", "pillar": "Conversion Strategy", "priority": "Hot", "status": "Idea", "day": "", "created": "2026-05-10T10:00:00.000Z", "month": "May 2026", "monthSlug": "2026-05", "isNew": true}, {"id": "case-study-roas-funnel-rebuild-20260510", "type": "Case Study", "title": "The funnel that dropped a DTC brand's ROAS from 1.2x to 4.8x — without changing a single product page", "slug": "roas-funnel-rebuild-listiku-advertorial", "brief": "Case study documenting a full funnel rebuild: replacing direct-to-PDP cold traffic with listiku → advertorial → PDP architecture. Shows before/after metrics and what each page changed.", "angle": "Solve > Ship > Sharpen", "pillar": "Conversion Strategy", "priority": "Hot", "status": "Idea", "day": "", "created": "2026-05-10T10:00:00.000Z", "month": "May 2026", "monthSlug": "2026-05", "isNew": true}, {"id": "cro-fix-advertorial-pdp-handoff-20260510", "type": "CRO Fix", "title": "Your advertorial to PDP handoff is broken. Here's the design gap that breaks trust at the last step", "slug": "advertorial-pdp-handoff-trust-gap", "brief": "Zooms into the transition between advertorial and PDP — how visual language, tone continuity, and CTA consistency between pages creates or kills momentum at the hot-traffic stage.", "angle": "'Every page is a product. Every click is a choice.'", "pillar": "Conversion Strategy", "priority": "Hot", "status": "Idea", "day": "", "created": "2026-05-10T10:00:00.000Z", "month": "May 2026", "monthSlug": "2026-05", "isNew": true}, {"id": "personal-drove-traffic-pdp-mistake-20260510", "type": "Personal", "title": "I drove all ad traffic straight to the PDP for 6 months. Then I saw a client's data. I've never done it since.", "slug": "drove-traffic-pdp-6-months-lesson", "brief": "Personal story about the moment Ridwan understood funnel temperature 