t matrices, lookbook integration, size guide optimization, and why generic themes fail this vertical", "angle": "Industry-specific pricing strategy revelation", "pillar": "Builder's Journey", "priority": "Hot", "status": "Idea", "day": "Friday", "created": "2026-04-24T11:30:31.175Z", "month": "April 2026", "monthSlug": "2026-04", "week": null, "source": "monthly-ideas", "sourceSet": "2026-04"}, {"id": "idea-trust-signals-that-kill-sales-the-over-credibility-1777030231175-glacc", "type": "CRO Fix", "title": "Trust Signals That Kill Sales: The Over-Credibility Problem", "slug": "trust-signals-that-kill-sales-the-over-credibility", "brief": "Analysis of trust badge overload, review widget spam, and security seal redundancy - when too many trust signals create decision paralysis", "angle": "Unexpected trust signal optimization angle", "pillar": "Conversion Strategy", "priority": "Warm", "status": "Idea", "day": "Wednesday", "created": "2026-04-24T11:30:31.175Z", "month": "April 2026", "monthSlug": "2026-04", "week": null, "source": "monthly-ideas", "sourceSet": "2026-04"}, {"id": "idea-instant-page-builder-custom-section-architecture-1777030231175-0qoo2", "type": "Tip", "title": "Instant Page Builder: Custom Section Architecture", "slug": "instant-page-builder-custom-section-architecture", "brief": "Advanced Instant techniques for complex layouts - nested sections, conditional logic, and dynamic content blocks that maintain theme performance", "angle": "Deep tool expertise for advanced users", "pillar": "Digital Craftsmanship", "priority": "Cold", "status": "Idea", "day": "Monday", "created": "2026-04-24T11:30:31.175Z", "month": "April 2026", "monthSlug": "2026-04", "week": null, "source": "monthly-ideas", "sourceSet": "2026-04"}, {"id": "idea-the-email-capture-that-converted-47-of-mobile-traf-1777030231175-iw7ww", "type": "Case Study", "title": "The Email Capture That Converted 47% of Mobile Traffic", "slug": "the-email-capture-that-converted-47-of-mobile-traf", "brief": "Breakdown of exit-intent alternative for mobile - timing, copy, and incentive strategy that worked for direct-to-consumer wellness brand", "angle": "Mobile-specific lead generation with high conversion data", "pillar": "Conversion Strategy", "priority": "Hot", "status": "Idea", "day": "Friday", "created": "2026-04-24T11:30:31.175Z", "month": "April 2026", "monthSlug": "2026-04", "week": null, "source": "monthly-ideas", "sourceSet": "2026-04"}, {"id": "idea-my-3am-debugging-sessions-taught-me-this-about-liq-1777030231175-wel4i", "type": "Personal", "title": "My 3AM Debugging Sessions Taught Me This About Liquid", "slug": "my-3am-debugging-sessions-taught-me-this-about-liq", "brief": "Personal story about liquid syntax gotchas, object relationships, and the debugging approach that saves hours of theme development frustration", "angle": "Vulnerable technical learning experience", "pillar": "Digital Craftsmanship", "priority": "Warm", "status": "Idea", "day": "Friday", "created": "2026-04-24T11:30:31.175Z", "month": "April 2026", "monthSlug": "2026-04", "week": null, "source": "monthly-ideas", "sourceSet": "2026-04"}, {"id": "idea-checkout-abandonment-fix-the-payment-method-order-1777030231175-ebzqg", "type": "CRO Fix", "title": "Checkout Abandonment Fix: The Payment Method Order", "slug": "checkout-abandonment-fix-the-payment-method-order", "brief": "A/B test results showing 12% conversion lift from reordering payment options - regional preferences and cognitive load considerations", "angle": "Micro-optimization with significant impact", "pillar": "Conversion Strategy", "priority": "Hot", "status": "Idea", "day": "Wednesday", "created": "2026-04-24T11:30:31.175Z", "month": "April 2026", "monthSlug": "2026-04", "week": null, "source": "monthly-ideas", "sourceSet": "2026-04"}, {"id": "idea-design-system-tokens-for-shopify-css-custom-proper-1777030231175-402cb", "type": "Tip", "title": "Design System Tokens for Shopify: CSS Custom Properties Setup", "slug": "design-system-tokens-for-shopify-css-custom-proper", "brief": "Implementation guide for scalable design systems using CSS variables - color schemes, spacing scales, and typography that work across theme updates", "angle": "Advanced design system methodology", "pillar": "Digital Craftsmanship", "priority": "Cold", "status": "Idea", "day": "Monday", "created": "2026-04-24T11:30:31.175Z", "month": "April 2026", "monthSlug": "2026-04", "week": null, "source": "monthly-ideas", "sourceSet": "2026-04"}, {"id": "idea-i-lost-a-15k-project-over-this-communication-mista-1777030231175-xyiui", "type": "Personal", "title": "I Lost a $15K Project Over This Communication Mistake", "slug": "i-lost-a-15k-project-over-this-communication-mista", "brief": "Story of project scope misalignment, the specific email that caused the breakdown, and the client communication framework developed to prevent repeats", "angle": "Expensive lesson learned with prevention strategy", "pillar": "Builder's Journey", "priority": "Warm", "status": "Idea", "day": "Friday", "created": "2026-04-24T11:30:31.175Z", "month": "April 2026", "monthSlug": "2026-04", "week": null, "source": "monthly-ideas", "sourceSet": "2026-04"}, {"id": "idea-product-video-placement-above-vs-below-the-fold-da-1777030231175-6d2qz", "type": "Case Study", "title": "Product Video Placement: Above vs Below the Fold Data", "slug": "product-video-placement-above-vs-below-the-fold-da", "brief": "Split test analysis across 8 stores comparing hero video placement - engagement rates, scroll behavior, and conversion impact by product category", "angle": "Video optimization with cross-vertical data", "pillar": "Conversion Strategy", "priority": "Warm", "status": "Idea", "day": "Friday", "created": "2026-04-24T11:30:31.175Z", "month": "April 2026", "monthSlug": "2026-04", "week": null, "source": "monthly-ideas", "sourceSet": "2026-04"}, {"id": "idea-typography-hierarchy-that-converts-the-6-level-sys-1777030231175-j3p4a", "type": "Tip", "title": "Typography Hierarchy That Converts: The 6-Level System", "slug": "typography-hierarchy-that-converts-the-6-level-sys", "brief": "Font weight, size, and spacing progression that guides purchase decisions - how typographic contrast creates conversion funnels within page layouts", "angle": "Design fundamentals with conversion focus", "pillar": "Digital Craftsmanship", "priority": "Cold", "status": "Idea", "day": "Monday", "created": "2026-04-24T11:30:31.175Z", "month": "April 2026", "monthSlug": "2026-04", "week": null, "source": "monthly-ideas", "sourceSet": "2026-04"}, {"id": "tip-why-your-pdp-loses-sales-at-60-scroll-brief-audit--1777031016447", "type": "Tip", "title": "Why Your PDP Loses Sales at 60% Scroll (brief: Audit framework showing how most product pages die in the middle section where trust signals should live. Walk through the exact elements missing between hero and reviews that kill momentum.) {angle: Focus on the ignored middle-scroll deadzone, not just above-fold or checkout. type: CRO Fix. Pillar: conversion strategy}", "slug": "why-your-pdp-loses-sales-at-60-scroll-brief-audit-", "status": "Created", "day": "Monday", "created": "2026-04-24T11:43:36.447Z", "folder": "outputs/tips/why-your-pdp-loses-sales-at-60-scroll-brief-audit-_2026-04-24.html", "week": "Week of Apr 20", "month": "April 2026", "monthSlug": "2026-04", "source": "tip-generator"}, {"id": "cro-fix-v1ce_tap-review-card-20260707", "type": "CRO Fix", "title": "V1CE Tap Review Card — CRO Breakdown", "slug": "v1ce_tap-review-card", "status": "Ready", "day": "", "created": "2026-07-07T17:22:54.995Z", "folder": "outputs/cro-fixes/v1ce_tap-review-card_content.html", "week": "Week of July 7", "month": "July 2026", "monthSlug": "2026-07", "reviewedAt": "2026-07-12T00:00:00.000Z", "reviewNote": "Step 8 checklist passed. Added explicit unofficial-concept disclaimer to all caption variants (was missing) before approval.", "distribution": [{"post_id": "cro-fix-v1ce_tap-review-card-20260714-20260722-li-0900", "